<view class="screen">
  <view class="header"><text class="title">目标与体重趋势</text></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="vcard"><view class="between"><text class="heading">当前目标 · {{goal}}</text><button class="link" data-page="diet" data-mode="profile" bindtap="follow">调整目标</button></view><view wx:if="{{profile}}" class="metric">{{profile.targets.kcal}} <text>千卡 / 天</text></view><view class="fine">先观察，再调整。一天的体重变化不代表脂肪变化。</view></view>
  <view class="vcard"><view class="heading">记录身体变化</view><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" end="{{today}}" data-k="date" bindchange="field"><view class="field">{{date}} ▾</view></picker><view class="fields"><label>体重 · kg<input class="field" type="digit" value="{{weight}}" data-k="weight" bindinput="field" placeholder="例如 70.5"/></label><label>腰围 · cm（选填）<input class="field" type="digit" value="{{waist}}" data-k="waist" bindinput="field" placeholder="每周记录即可"/></label></view><view class="fine">尽量在相近条件下称重。同一天保存会更新该日记录，不会立即改变饮食目标。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="saveWeight" loading="{{busy}}">保存体重</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{result}}" class="vcard"><view class="heading">相邻两周趋势</view><view class="metric-grid"><view><text class="muted">前一周 · {{result.counts[0]}} 天</text><view class="trend-number">{{result.means[0] || '—'}} <text>kg</text></view></view><view><text class="muted">最近一周 · {{result.counts[1]}} 天</text><view class="trend-number">{{result.means[1] || '—'}} <text>kg</text></view></view></view><view class="callout">{{result.reason}}</view><button wx:if="{{result.goalReached}}" class="link" data-page="diet" data-mode="profile" bindtap="follow">重新评估阶段目标</button><view wx:if="{{result.recommendation}}"><view class="strong">建议从 {{result.recommendation.effectiveFrom}} 起，每日 {{result.recommendation.targets.kcal}} 千卡</view><button class="primary" bindtap="accept">接受调整</button></view><view wx:if="{{result.pending}}"><view class="strong">{{result.pending.effectiveFrom}} 起 {{result.pending.targets.kcal}} 千卡</view><button class="link" bindtap="cancel">取消待生效调整</button></view></view>
  <view class="vcard"><view class="heading">每周执行反馈</view><view class="fine">记录日期 {{date}}，回顾这一周。请选择真实情况，记录不足时不会自动减餐。</view><label class="feedback-label">饮食执行<picker range="{{adherenceOptions}}" data-k="adherence" data-list="adherenceOptions" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{adherence}} ▾</view></picker></label><label>身体感受<picker range="{{wellbeingOptions}}" data-k="wellbeing" data-list="wellbeingOptions" bindchange="pick"><view class="field">{{wellbeing}} ▾</view></picker></label><view class="between"><text>经期、盐分等短期波动</text><switch checked="{{waterChange}}" data-k="waterChange" bindchange="field"/></view><button class="link wide" bindtap="saveFeedback">保存本周反馈</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{result.records.length}}" class="vcard"><view class="heading">体重记录</view><view wx:for="{{result.records}}" wx:key="date" class="trend-row"><text>{{item.date}}</text><text>{{item.weight}} kg</text><text>{{item.waist ? item.waist+' cm' : '—'}}</text></view></view>
</view>
